--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: SkillBook_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 437d1851397a6a242b0186b1d4ede023, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 37093555872231424
    m_Localized: Peach Blossom Art
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37093555926757376
    m_Localized: "A divine art created by a nameless peerless master, who wove the
      beauty of blooming peach blossoms and a timeless eternity that never fades
      into the principles of martial arts.\n\nNothing is known of its creator's deeds,
      nor which sect they belonged to. \n\nWith no lineage left to carry on its legacy,
      it remained buried in the history of Jianghu for ages.\n\nThe inner energy
      cultivated through the Peach Blossom Art is exceptionally pure, circulating
      unimpeded along the energy channels.\n\nThe true value of the Peach Blossom
      Art lies not in the sheer volume or power of its inner energy.\n\nJust as blooming
      peach blossoms blend seamlessly with countless flowers, its energy rejects
      no aura, embracing them all to ultimately harmonize into a single, unified
      flow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37093555926757377
    m_Localized: A divine art created by a nameless peerless master, who wove the
      beauty of blooming peach blossoms and a timeless eternity into the principles
      of martial arts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287166177280
    m_Localized: Jianghu Samjae sword method
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36370287083155456
    m_Localized: 'A low-grade sword manual compiled by a nameless, third-rate swordsman
      wandering Jianghu, who clumsily imitated the stances and principles of the
      authentic Samjae sword just to make a living.


      Despite its grand name,
      it is in truth nothing more than a superficial imitation that barely copies
      the outer form of the genuine art.


      In particular, because its name
      is overly similar to the orthodox Samjae sword Sword, and the prefix ''Jianghu''
      lends a misleading air of mastery, novice martial artists and uneducated wanderers
      frequently confuse it with the authentic manual.


      The stances themselves
      appear convincing enough to deceive beginners, but the transitions between
      sword paths and the subtle principles of the techniques are crude, allowing
      any warrior with a discerning eye to instantly perceive its limits.


      Though
      widely circulated in common markets due to its cheap price and ease of mastery,
      orthodox sects strongly discourage learning it, viewing it as a vulgar style
      that ruins the fundamentals of swordsmanship.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287229091840
    m_Localized: A low-grade sword manual compiled by a nameless, third-rate swordsman
      wandering Jianghu, who clumsily imitated the stances and principles of the
      authentic Samjae sword just to make a living
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287229091841
    m_Localized: Returning Flow Technique
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36370287112515584
    m_Localized: 'A singular secret art created from enlightenment gained by observing
      the flow of water, focusing on deflecting and returning an opponent''s force
      rather than receiving it head-on.


      Instead of forcibly blocking incoming
      power and momentum, the practitioner moves their body along the flow, exploiting
      the openings created in the process to transition into a counterattack.


      The
      movements of the Returning Flow Technique are fluid and natural like flowing
      water, yet the continuous sequence of pulling back, deflecting, and driving
      inward leaves opponents unable to easily discern whether their attack was blocked
      or lured.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287229091842
    m_Localized: A singular secret art created from enlightenment gained by observing
      the flow of water, focusing on deflecting and returning an opponent's force
      rather than receiving it head-on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287229091843
    m_Localized: Hunting Fang Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36370287112515585
    m_Localized: "A swordsmanship style that does not blindly rush after prey, but
      rather pulls back to await the opportune moment, lunging in like fangs the
      instant an opening appears. \n\nWhile its stances are restrained, once an opportunity
      is seized, it aims to settle the outcome in a single breath through a direct
      charge and a sharp strike. \n\nRather than spamming unnecessary techniques,
      it focuses on measuring distance and timing, specializing in driving the blade
      straight in by targeting the moment an enemy's attack finishes or their posture
      falters."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287229091844
    m_Localized: 'A swordsmanship style that does not blindly rush after prey, but
      rather pulls back to await the opportune moment, lunging in like fangs the
      instant an opening appears. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287229091845
    m_Localized: Monkey Trickster Style Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36370287112515586
    m_Localized: "A deceptive swordsmanship style that mocks opponents like a cunning
      monkey. \n\nAfter leaping forward to strike in a split second, the practitioner
      lightly hops back like a monkey before the enemy can counter, letting sword
      energy slide off while driving the enemy to anger. \n\nRather than clashing
      swords head-on, it focuses on disrupting the pace of battle through unpredictable
      jumps and rapid retreats. \n\nWhat appears at first glance to be a frivolous
      flight hides the subtle art of luring that makes a fool of the opponent. \n\nThus,
      orthodox warriors who value solemn discipline may criticize it as frivolous
      and underhanded, but in practical combat, it is recognized as a brilliant psychological
      technique that completely shatters an enemy's composure, forcing them to expose
      their own openings. \n\nLight as a feather and utterly sly, its fluid rhythm
      of striking and pulling away\u2014much like a monkey navigating between trees\u2014is
      so erratic that opponents find themselves swinging at empty air."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287229091846
    m_Localized: A deceptive swordsmanship style that mocks opponents like a cunning
      monkey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287229091847
    m_Localized: Ascending Dragon Storm Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36370287112515587
    m_Localized: 'An aggressive swordsmanship style that relentlessly builds momentum
      like an ascending dragon, raining down strikes like a fierce storm.


      Its
      momentum is wild and ferocious, specializing in overwhelming the opponent with
      a barrage of continuous strikes once its momentum takes hold.


      While
      its footwork and sword trajectories are straightforward and bold, the sheer
      speed and pressure make it nearly impossible to block head-on.


      With
      every flash of the blade, it leaves the opponent with the illusion of being
      caught in a violent gale, its momentum growing ever fiercer as the assault
      continues.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287229091848
    m_Localized: An aggressive swordsmanship style that relentlessly builds momentum
      like an ascending dragon, raining down strikes like a fierce storm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287229091849
    m_Localized: Greenwood Seventy-Two Body Tempering Technique
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36370287112515588
    m_Localized: "A bamboo scroll compiling seventy-two external training methods
      passed down quietly like secret arts among the Greenwood strongholds. \n\nCarved
      onto roughly chiseled wooden slats in crude handwriting, it appears at first
      glance like a simple training manual of bandits, yet each technique within
      is said to boast remarkable efficiency. \n\nBorn out of the need to survive
      the brutal combat and harsh mountain living unique to the Greenwood, it specializes
      in tempering the bones and forging the physique into steel.\n\nThose who practice
      it consistently are said to gain a robust body that cannot be easily felled
      by blades or clubs. \n\nRumors even claim that mastering it completely allows
      one to attain a body comparable to Diamond Invulnerability."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287229091850
    m_Localized: 'A bamboo scroll compiling seventy-two external training methods
      passed down quietly like secret arts among the Greenwood strongholds. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287229091851
    m_Localized: Return to Origin Technique
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36370287112515589
    m_Localized: "An orthodox internal cultivation method that gathers scattered
      Qi, blood, and internal energy back to the dantian, refining the body into
      its most ideal state. \n\nRather than merely accumulating internal energy,
      it corrects twisted energy meridians and expels turbid Qi, returning the circulation
      of Qi close to its origin. \n\nThough the growth of internal energy is gradual,
      repeated practice makes the meridians ever sturdier and the internal energy
      pure. \n\nThe martial arts performed upon this foundation unleash an even more
      stable power."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36341287229091852
    m_Localized: 'An orthodox internal cultivation method that gathers scattered
      Qi, blood, and internal energy back to the dantian, refining the body into
      its most ideal state. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 48927105154142208
    m_Localized: ' '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588616105984
    m_Localized: Peach Blossom - Eternal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466112
    m_Localized: Allows you to perceive and interact with Peach Blossom Saplings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466113
    m_Localized: 'Peach blossoms are a symbol of perpetual youth and immortality.


      It
      is said that even if one who has mastered this divine art falls, their body
      will not rot away, but be reborn from a Peach Blossom Sapling rooted somewhere
      in the world.


      Furthermore, touching a Peach Blossom Sapling is said
      to teleport the practitioner to another sapling, guided by the lingering inner
      energy within it.


      Whether this is a mercy left behind by the peerless
      master for future generations, or an eternal fetter that refuses to grant even
      the peace of death, none can truly say.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466114
    m_Localized: Peach Blossom - Life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466115
    m_Localized: 'When Health drops to 30% or below, gradually recovers and regenerates
      up to 70%.

      This power triggers up to 1 time, and can be recharged by
      resting at a Peach Blossom Tree.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466116
    m_Localized: 'The body of one who has mastered the Peach Blossom Art is said
      to be imbued with the vitality of peach blossoms.


      As long as the spark
      of life is not completely extinguished, the energy asleep deep within the dantian
      awakens on its own to connect severed meridians and restore scattered Qi and
      blood.


      Once it has recovered, that energy is fully exhausted, and only
      by absorbing the energy of life through the Peach Blossom Tree again will that
      power become full.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466132
    m_Localized: Horizontal Slash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466133
    m_Localized: Swings the sword from side to side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466134
    m_Localized: "It is the most fundamental cutting arc, used to sweep an area and
      halt an enemy's advance. \n\nThough simple in appearance, left-right balance
      and a sense of distance are key."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466135
    m_Localized: Vertical Slash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466136
    m_Localized: 'Strikes down with the sword from above. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466137
    m_Localized: "Loaded with linear force and weight, it is used to shatter the
      opponent's defense head-on. \n\nSimple though it may seem, it is also the most
      profound movement."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466138
    m_Localized: Thrust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466139
    m_Localized: 'Extends the tip of the sword straight forward to thrust. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466140
    m_Localized: A precise attack that achieves maximum focus with minimal movement,
      where distance control and split-second judgment are essential.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466141
    m_Localized: Horse Stance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466142
    m_Localized: "Spread both feet wider than shoulder-width, bend the knees, and
      maintain a posture as if riding a horse. \n\nBegin with half a ke and gradually
      increase the duration up to one shijin. \n\nIf the waist collapses or the heels
      lift, start over from the beginning. \n\nIf one slights physical conditioning,
      nothing can be accomplished."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466143
    m_Localized: Swift Running
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466144
    m_Localized: "Run every day back and forth across mountain paths and flat terrain
      at a steady pace. \n\nDo not compete for speed, but maintain a stride where
      your breathing remains undisturbed. \n\nIn Jianghu, martial skills are important,
      but stamina that prevents exhaustion no matter what technique you perform is
      equally vital."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466145
    m_Localized: Meditation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466146
    m_Localized: "Straighten your back, sit in the lotus position, and cast away
      stray thoughts. \n\nClose your eyes, slowly inhale through your nose, and exhale
      long through your mouth. \n\nDo not force your breathing to be long; maintain
      a natural flow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466147
    m_Localized: Three-Harmonies Training
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466148
    m_Localized: "By practicing the three foundational disciplines\u2014Horse Stance,
      Swift Running, and Meditation\u2014every day, one tempers the body, regulates
      the breath, and settles the mind. \n\nThrough this, one realizes the basic
      ways of handling the sword and builds an unshakable foundation for swordsmanship."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466149
    m_Localized: Returning Flow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466150
    m_Localized: 'Softly deflects an opponent''s attack using the blade and momentum
      of the sword rather than taking it head-on. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466151
    m_Localized: "Instead of forcibly blocking the power behind an attack, it disperses
      the force along its flow. \n\nA portion of the impact and energy that would
      be expended in the process is harvested and converted back into true energy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466152
    m_Localized: "Flow Reversal \u2013 Surplus"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466153
    m_Localized: Successfully performing Returning Flow increases Attack for a short
      duration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466154
    m_Localized: "At the moment you deflect an opponent\u2019s attack, you add its
      momentum to your own movement, briefly turning its force to your advantage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466155
    m_Localized: Returning Flow - Augment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466156
    m_Localized: Increases the duration of Returning Flow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466157
    m_Localized: By slightly tweaking the stance of Returning Flow, the window of
      time to receive enemy attacks increases, lessening the strain on the body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466158
    m_Localized: Walking Against the Flow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466159
    m_Localized: "Walk against the current of a shallow valley stream. \n\nThe goal
      is not to advance quickly, but to feel the flow of water with your entire body,
      aligning your breath and steps as one.\n\nInstead of bracing with your toes,
      fully accept the flow and support your balance through your waist and lower
      body."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466160
    m_Localized: Contemplation the Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466161
    m_Localized: "Sit by a flowing stream and observe the movement of the water for
      a long time. \n\nDo not forcibly chase the ripples, but accept its passage
      just as it is. \n\nEngrave into your mind the principle that no matter what
      obstacle it encounters, it carves a new path and never loses its ultimate flow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466162
    m_Localized: Retreating Fang
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466163
    m_Localized: 'Swings the sword in successive diagonals while stepping back two
      paces. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466164
    m_Localized: This is not a simple retreat, but a movement meant to disrupt the
      opponent's focus and gauge distance, akin to a hunter backing away to observe
      the prey's movements and secure striking range rather than rushing in recklessly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466165
    m_Localized: Hunting Fang
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466166
    m_Localized: 'Instantly closes the distance to drive the sword forward. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466167
    m_Localized: Like a predator crouching low before pouncing upon its prey, it
      pierces the opponent's vital point with a sudden burst of acceleration.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466168
    m_Localized: Wooden Club Body Tempering
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466169
    m_Localized: "Hardens the physical body by beating the entire frame with rounded
      wooden clubs. \n\nStriking the body with constant pressure, one learns to regulate
      breathing and consolidate power at the moment of impact. \n\nThe goal is not
      to injure the body, but to accustom it to repeated blows, forging a physique
      that will not easily collapse even under the ambush of a wild beast."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466170
    m_Localized: Mountain Trek
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466171
    m_Localized: "Traverse up and down mountains every day to build stamina. \n\nChoosing
      steep slopes and rocky paths over flat terrain, one maintains a steady stride
      to keep breathing undisturbed. \n\nThrough this, one builds a body that never
      loses its center of gravity, regardless of the terrain."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466172
    m_Localized: Physical Combat Training
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466173
    m_Localized: "Assuming a situation where one becomes entangled with game, this
      training teaches how to subdue targets single-handedly. \n\nInstead of exchanging
      punches, the focus lies on applying body weight to push, grab, and take them
      down. \n\nTo a hunter, what matters is not an honorable victory, but ultimate
      survival.\n\nIf necessary, one subdues the opponent with the resolve to sacrifice
      flesh to carve bone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466174
    m_Localized: Ape's Playful Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466175
    m_Localized: 'Instantly leaps forward to swing the sword, then immediately pulls
      back to return to the original position. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466176
    m_Localized: Like a monkey playing in the trees to mock onlookers, this technique
      weaves elusive movements to maintain distance rather than engaging in honest
      exchanges, focusing on constantly repeating advance and retreat to blur the
      opponent's gaze and judgment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466177
    m_Localized: Playful Retreat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466178
    m_Localized: 'Quickly swings the sword and steps back. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466179
    m_Localized: Deliberately opening distance confounds the opponent's judgment,
      creating opportunities to target enemies who lose their composure and blindly
      pursue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466180
    m_Localized: Monkey's Nimble Footwork
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466181
    m_Localized: 'When locked onto a target, the cooldown for dodging is reduced. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466182
    m_Localized: "A subtle technique derived from the nimble movements of monkeys.\n\n
      allowing the practitioner to move their body even more swiftly to evade enemy
      attacks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466183
    m_Localized: Coexisting with Apes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466184
    m_Localized: "Live in the mountains alongside a troop of monkeys, mastering their
      movements through firsthand experience. \n\nFrom foraging for food and climbing
      trees to leaping and rolling, every action is shared with them. \n\nAll training
      in the Ape's Playful Sword begins with living among monkeys."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466185
    m_Localized: Forest Play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466186
    m_Localized: "Run through the forest and scale trees alongside the monkeys. \n\nStamina
      naturally increases while cultivating bodily flexibility and a sense of balance.
      \n\nLeaping between branches also trains split-second judgment and agile body
      techniques."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466187
    m_Localized: Ape Stride Qi Cultivation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466188
    m_Localized: "Roam the forest with the monkey troop, absorbing the energy of
      nature. \n\nWhile climbing trees and leaping across branches, maintain unbroken
      breathing to steadily accumulate the clear energy of the forest into the dantian.
      \n\nThe more lightly one moves like a monkey, the more seamlessly the Qi flows."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466189
    m_Localized: Gale Slash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466190
    m_Localized: Instantly sheathes the sword and swiftly draws it for a slash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466191
    m_Localized: ' A form of quick-draw technique; at the moment the blade completely
      clears the scabbard, the distortion of airflow created between the blade and
      scabbard becomes a razor-sharp wind, moving as if alive like a follow-up lethal
      strike to cut through the space that was already severed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466192
    m_Localized: Sky-Shattering Tempest
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466193
    m_Localized: "Slashes the sword upward. \nThe energy condensed along the blade
      erupts all at once, soaring upward to form a tempest. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466194
    m_Localized: The moment the blade swings from bottom to top, the condensed sword
      Qi explodes and skyrockets into the heavens. Subsequently, in the path where
      the blade passed, torn air currents twist and spread outward like a storm.
      Like the shed skin left behind by an Imugi that has already ascended into the
      sky, it is the residual aftermath left at the peak of ascension.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466195
    m_Localized: Gale Slash - Mighty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466196
    m_Localized: 'Increases the hit count of Gale Slash by 1. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466197
    m_Localized: Dramatically twisting the body, the practitioner draws the sword
      at blinding speed. The sword wind born from a single quick-draw splits into
      far more branches, enveloping all directions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466198
    m_Localized: Sky-Shattering Tempest - Ascend
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466199
    m_Localized: 'Summons an even more powerful storm. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466200
    m_Localized: The storm finally transcends the realm of the Imugi, unleashing
      a storm as magnificent as it is cruel, like the scales shed by a true dragon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466201
    m_Localized: Dream of Ascension
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466202
    m_Localized: "Like an Flood Dragon that has endured hundreds of years in the
      subterranean abyss dreaming of ascension, one lowers their posture to endlessly
      condense power until the moment it can no longer be contained, swinging the
      blade with all their might. \n\nAs this cycle of condensation and explosion
      repeats, the momentum of the sword grows ever fiercer, until it finally attains
      the momentum of a dragon ascending to the heavens."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466203
    m_Localized: Hidden Dragon's Meditation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466204
    m_Localized: "A training discipline of enduring long years, like an Imugi biding
      its time for ascension. \n\nOne lowers their body within a narrow cave and
      maintains the exact same posture for extended periods. \n\nEven as muscles
      tremble and breathing grows ragged, the posture is never broken, allowing one
      to realize the explosive power that comes at the end of endurance."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466205
    m_Localized: Bloody Hand Tree Felling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466206
    m_Localized: "Strike and shatter hard timber hundreds and thousands of times
      with bare fists. \n\nIt emphasizes the tenacity to keep striking without losing
      strength, even when blood flows from the knuckles. \n\nIt is said that at the
      moment the log finally splits open, one obtains fists like iron."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466207
    m_Localized: Death-Slope Climbing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466208
    m_Localized: "Climb up and down cliffs and steep slopes barehanded. \n\nWhen
      strength in the arms runs out, endure with the legs; when even the legs give
      way, press the entire body against the rock and crawl. \n\nEven if one falls,
      as long as life remains, start over from the beginning, tempering endurance
      and grip strength through endless repetition."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466209
    m_Localized: Boulder Slam Tempering
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466210
    m_Localized: "Temper the physical body by slamming the entire body against giant
      boulders. \n\nStarting with light impacts, gradually increase the force to
      endure shocks powerful enough to shatter rock. \n\nTorn flesh and bruises are
      ordinary occurrences; the purpose is to forge a robust body that remains unshaken
      by any shock."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466211
    m_Localized: Brawling Sparring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466212
    m_Localized: "Those who have learned the Greenwood Seventy-Two Body Tempering
      Technique beat each other up all day long to temper their bodies. \n\nThere
      are no stances or rules; one gets beaten until collapsing, then rises again
      to swing fists. \n\nBruises and wounds are regarded as badges of honor, and
      ending training before the blood dries is considered a disgrace. \n\nThrough
      endless brawling, the body grows accustomed to impact, and the mind learns
      never to succumb to pain."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466213
    m_Localized: Return to Origin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466214
    m_Localized: Halts all Qi circulation and learns to guide scattered Qi back to
      the dantian.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466215
    m_Localized: Gathering Qi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466216
    m_Localized: "Regulates the breath and senses the Qi scattered throughout the
      body. \n\nQi is not meant to be forcibly mastered, but allowed to flow in naturally.
      \n\nWithout forcibly pulling the detected internal Qi, gently guide it back
      to the dantian. \n\nImpatience will disturb the flow of Qi, leaving internal
      injuries and, in severe cases, leading to Qi deviation."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466217
    m_Localized: Meridian Alignment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466218
    m_Localized: "Slowly circulates the internal energy gathered in the dantian along
      the Twelve Main Meridians and Eight Extraordinary Vessels. \n\nIt clears blocked
      energy channels, rights twisted blood vessels, and evenly smooths the flow
      of the entire body. \n\nForcing the flow of Qi or violating the proper sequence
      strains the meridians; in severe cases, Qi and blood become entangled, causing
      excruciating pain."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466219
    m_Localized: Qi Refining
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466220
    m_Localized: "Refines gathered Qi to strip away impurities. \n\nThe internal
      energy gradually changes into a natural state no different from the Qi of Heaven
      and Earth. \n\nPure and refined internal energy flows without any resistance
      from the body, allowing whatever martial arts or cultivation mind-laws are
      performed to be executed with far greater elegance and precision."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466221
    m_Localized: Meridian Fortification
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466222
    m_Localized: "By repeatedly tempering the energy meridians and blood vessels,
      the body itself is perfected into a singular vessel. \n\nOne gains the power
      to deflect impacts, becoming resistant to internal injuries while forging a
      resilient physique that is not easily harmed by external wounds. \n\nTempered
      meridians do not waver even under violent Qi circulation and can stably receive
      any energy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466223
    m_Localized: Return to the True Origin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47229588645466224
    m_Localized: "The ultimate secret of the Return to Origin Technique. \n\nAll
      remaining impure Qi within the body vanishes, and the act of Qi circulation
      itself becomes pure instinct. \n\nEven without forcibly moving internal energy,
      the Qi naturally circulates through the most ideal paths. \n\nAny internal
      cultivation method or martial art learned hereafter can achieve an even higher
      level of perfection, while the possibility of conflict with other mind-laws
      is drastically reduced."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
